        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Paper Scissors: The Roguelike Puzzle Games is a Roguelike Puzzle Game about playing Rock Paper Scissors...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199400/extras/3c2ee1605a4051f567172a1f894665f8.avif?t=1766485895\" width=1024 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the strategy of traditional Rock, Paper Scissors to destroy enough blocks to clear each round and accumulate increasingly higher scores. By placing the correct blocks on one another and gaining enough combos to beat the goal you will get access to the shop and equipment menus where you can buy and equip powerful blocks that help you increase your score even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199400/extras/738bae9fa28ddb799c80f668cd47e2fe.avif?t=1766485895\" width=345 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be on the lookout for negative blocks that will try to hurt your experience and stop your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199400/extras/c830af7ed3d88373389849d5c564053d.avif?t=1766485895\" width=345 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roguelike puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several combinations that can max out your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up blocks and improve them via stat boost blocks to improve your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds play a game of Rock, Paper, Scissors for a chance to gain stat boosts but risk getting debuffs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Paper Scissors: The Roguelike Puzzle Games is a Roguelike Puzzle Game about playing Rock Paper Scissors...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199400/extras/3c2ee1605a4051f567172a1f894665f8.avif?t=1766485895\" width=1024 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the strategy of traditional Rock, Paper Scissors to destroy enough blocks to clear each round and accumulate increasingly higher scores. By placing the correct blocks on one another and gaining enough combos to beat the goal you will get access to the shop and equipment menus where you can buy and equip powerful blocks that help you increase your score even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199400/extras/738bae9fa28ddb799c80f668cd47e2fe.avif?t=1766485895\" width=345 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be on the lookout for negative blocks that will try to hurt your experience and stop your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199400/extras/c830af7ed3d88373389849d5c564053d.avif?t=1766485895\" width=345 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roguelike puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several combinations that can max out your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up blocks and improve them via stat boost blocks to improve your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds play a game of Rock, Paper, Scissors for a chance to gain stat boosts but risk getting debuffs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The Roguelike Puzzle game where you play Rock Paper Scissors and smash high scores with a variety of flavored blocks. Buy and equip power blocks to help you increase your score and get to the next round. Watch out for hazard blocks that may deter your progress and end your run.",
